WEBVTT

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:08.740
The ones who see things that shouldn't be seen,

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:11.960
are almost always naughty little children.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:19.410
It is because they possess the ability to sniff out secret hiding places.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.990
Hey, don't you think it's about time to meet up?

00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:31.880
Tanimachi's gonna bitch if we don't head back.

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:35.020
We're still good. Here, I got three 4s.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.320
Three of a kind, again?

00:00:37.320 --> 00:00:39.600
That's just wrong, Itakura!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.850
Anyone else? Got nothin', right?

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.530
Actually...

00:00:43.530 --> 00:00:45.120
Higashio, why you...

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:49.400
Crap!

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:00.470
A student from our school?

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:01.720
A girl?

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:02.560
Seriously?

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.760
Do something... Entertain me!

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:10.940
S-She's dead!

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:46.660
The towns entrance is adorned with a cow's skull

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:51.620
It's fine that the law is decided by the strongest,

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:56.610
But this simple feeling will not be enough to fulfill you

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:02.090
Everyone will definitely revolt and shortly disappear

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:07.370
That's a shocking bloody picture

00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:12.520
I'm feeling nauseous

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:22.730
Holding my head, I board the subway

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:33.170
Righteous way of living, righteous way of dying

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:43.620
Who on earth knows or what the hell can show me?

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:53.810
Cold finger girl

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:02.960
Sit Down

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:16.960
What'll we do, man?

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:21.310
Nozaki's "What'll we do, man?"s started again...

00:03:21.310 --> 00:03:22.550
How the hell should I know?

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:28.030
If you have any information...

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:28.030
Name: Yasuda Misako(15)

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:28.030
Height: 155cm thin build

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:28.030
Clothing: school jersey top and bottom

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:28.030
Went missing during an outdoors orientation.
Please contact if you have any information.

00:03:22.030 --> 00:03:28.030
Tel. 03-XXXX-XXXX

00:03:22.150 --> 00:03:25.110
But this is serious stuff!

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.660
We should tell someone what we saw!

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:30.090
Saw? Saw what?

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.240
You know...

00:03:31.660 --> 00:03:35.800
The fact that we saw someone carry up Yasuda's body, suck out all her insides,

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.670
and completely devour her, even the skin and bones?

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:40.410
Nobody's gonna believe that.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:42.340
What do you think, Yamada?

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:47.460
I wouldn't believe it either. And anyway, aren't you scared of whomever did it?

00:03:48.120 --> 00:03:50.400
It's here in our school.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.270
That... monster.

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:56.760
We should search for it, right?

00:03:57.200 --> 00:03:58.870
In order to defend ourselves.

00:03:58.870 --> 00:04:01.370
If we know, then we can stay away...

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:02.510
...from it.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.450
More than an hour? Not in my group, no.

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:14.080
Kanamori bailed on the way, but I think he was with Motoi.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.680
Went off on her own? I don't know.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:19.070
I went with another group, so...

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:24.500
Komiyama definitely went off from the group by himself, it sounds like.

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:28.220
I see... That makes four guys and one girl.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.650
We can eliminate Nakai too, right?

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:32.530
Since she's so short...

00:04:32.530 --> 00:04:34.930
In that case, that rules out Maehara as well.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.720
That guy's like 100 kilos, I think.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:38.470
Then the ones that are left are...

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.250
Komiyama from class B,

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.790
Horikoshi from class A,

00:04:41.790 --> 00:04:43.750
and Yamamoto, also from class A.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:47.960
If we knew more about the movements of those three...

00:04:47.960 --> 00:04:49.040
Best to back off.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:53.250
We already know it's got to be one of them.

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.530
That's plenty.

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:57.110
Yeah. And they're in different classes.

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.110
So, we just need to avoid them, right?

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:07.480
If we pry too deep and they come to get us, it'll backfire!

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:08.500
Right?

00:05:10.670 --> 00:05:12.710
Yeah, I got it.

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:16.850
The next day

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:18.640
The next day
Higashio didn't come to school.

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:21.850
The next day
Higashio didn't come to school.
He left home like he usually did,

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:23.550
and then disappeared...

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:27.140
I asked his girl, but she said she had no clue.

00:05:27.570 --> 00:05:30.590
I knew it! He went and investigated on his own afterwards!

00:05:30.590 --> 00:05:32.040
If that monster notices, we're...

00:05:32.040 --> 00:05:32.790
Shut up!

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.230
We might have been discovered!

00:05:35.230 --> 00:05:36.270
What'll we do, man?

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.750
I said shut the hell up!

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:38.770
But...

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:42.090
Maybe we should ask Ango-san.

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:45.280
Huh? He'll just laugh at us.

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:49.620
Still... It's better than just talking about it among ourselves.

00:05:59.260 --> 00:06:02.270
Sorry, but I'm gonna have to say goodbye to you cats today.

00:06:02.270 --> 00:06:03.590
Your heads are whacked out in a wrong direction.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:06.850
But we're sayin' it's not a joke, it's the truth!

00:06:06.850 --> 00:06:08.580
Please, tell us what to do!

00:06:09.020 --> 00:06:11.410
What the hell should I do?

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:12.680
Want me to kill the monster?

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.610
I'm like, way useless in a fight, man.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:16.550
No, I don't mean to kill it.

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:21.230
You know everyone, Ango-san. We thought you might know someone that could help...

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:23.410
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:26.000
Fine, that'll be 20,000 for the intro.

00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:27.320
You got it?

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.250
Yeah, barely...

00:06:35.800 --> 00:06:36.630
Here.

00:06:36.900 --> 00:06:38.320
What is it?

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:41.670
Try going there. It's an excellent clinic.

00:06:41.670 --> 00:06:44.080
But we're not sick, we're...

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:45.260
Don't interrupt me.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:48.790
You're going to be asked what course you want by a scary looking woman at reception.

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.510
Then you're going to answer "E course".

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.020
And...

00:06:53.940 --> 00:06:56.050
The rest is up to you.

00:07:08.020 --> 00:07:08.890
This is...

00:07:10.240 --> 00:07:12.630
Welcome. First time coming here?

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:15.540
Yes...

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.970
Which examination course would you like?

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:18.600
course

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:20.180
Day care
Time management
Mental health counseling

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:20.180
course

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:20.180
Brain wave measurement
Eating disorders
Explanation of basic points

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:20.180
course

00:07:18.050 --> 00:07:20.180
Psychosomatic medicine
Rehabilitation
Restore mental balance

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:23.170
Um...

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.780
E... course...

00:07:27.740 --> 00:07:29.400
As you wish.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:34.570
What in the world is "E course"?

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:35.500
Yeah...

00:07:37.880 --> 00:07:39.440
Come inside!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:41.790
R-Right!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:46.780
Welcome. Please, have a seat and relax.

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.400
Who gave you the introduction?

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:54.050
Um, a person named Sakamoto Ango.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:58.070
Now, now... Don't be hanging out with the likes of him.

00:07:58.070 --> 00:07:59.720
Your mind will slowly rot away.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.860
You know him?

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.110
A bit.

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:04.930
Now,

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:11.190
I'm going to ask you some questions to determine your aural comprehension.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.370
We'll discuss the details afterwards.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.660
Yasuda

00:08:18.160 --> 00:08:19.640
She'll definitely come back!

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:21.660
Yasuda

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:23.300
She said she wanted to go to the same college with you, Moe, remember?

00:08:23.300 --> 00:08:27.160
I'm sure she just had a fight with her parents and ran away from home!

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:29.960
Yeah...

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:34.580
Cheer up, Moe! We'll treat you to your favourite today, okay?

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.600
Yeah, that's right!

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.550
I see.

00:08:43.090 --> 00:08:43.970
Let me review.

00:08:44.410 --> 00:08:47.680
One: There is no way to authenticate the veracity of your story.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:51.990
Two: Even if it is the truth, you can't say it publicly.

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:56.210
On those two points, our opinions agree.

00:08:56.750 --> 00:08:57.490
Yes...

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:59.860
Then, the answer is simple.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:04.000
The correct way of dealing with it is to avoid the suspects.

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:06.330
Live your lives carefully, prudently,

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:09.710
but be prepared for the worst.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:11.700
That is all. Any questions?

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:14.960
Hold it! We already know all that!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:20.590
Isn't there anything else? Like, something we can do to protect ourselves from that monster?

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:23.390
For that, I'll need to do a careful investigation.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:25.860
And of course, that will cost extra.

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:27.090
How much?

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.840
Basic investigations are 1.5 million.

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:35.110
There's also a charge of 50,000 a day, and if I develop effective protective measures, 2 million.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.060
That's the minimum it'll take.

00:09:38.380 --> 00:09:40.610
And no. This isn't covered by your health insurance.

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.150
If you can't, then forget about it.

00:09:44.790 --> 00:09:45.750
Let's go.

00:09:45.750 --> 00:09:46.860
But...

00:09:46.860 --> 00:09:51.460
That's the wise choice. Currently, this is not so dangerous a situation.

00:09:52.630 --> 00:09:54.330
And how do you know that?

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:58.630
If it's for sustenance, it'd be more like one or two people a day.

00:09:58.630 --> 00:10:01.470
If you consider the number of people that have gone missing,

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:04.240
it's actually quite well-behaved among the ones that come to Earth.

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:06.220
Come to... Earth?

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:07.460
Oops.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.620
What do you mean?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.650
So be it...

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:18.210
What you saw was an extraterrestrial, a type II parasite.

00:10:19.630 --> 00:10:21.900
They pose as humans and wheedle their way into society.

00:10:21.900 --> 00:10:24.940
They inflict microscopic damage to humanity.

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:29.320
The risk in investigating parasitic types is quite high.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.850
They pretend to be humans and live among us.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:38.690
The problem is, however, that even though they can be communicated with,

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:41.320
they are often deceitful.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:48.430
Previously, one of my assistants investigated a similar case, and disappeared.

00:10:48.430 --> 00:10:50.970
His body was found, without his head.

00:10:51.520 --> 00:10:55.760
Many unknown bacteria taken from the wounds were detected,

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:58.250
but it was never announced publicly,

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:00.710
and was covered up as an accidental death.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:04.300
The last words he said right before he disappeared was:

00:11:04.300 --> 00:11:06.880
"You should have no fear in this case."

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:13.490
So? Do you understand now why my price is not exorbitant at all?

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:17.000
Who the hell are you?

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:21.870
Hmm, yes... You could call me an eccentric, I suppose.

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:26.840
And a few days later... Itakura disappeared.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.200
What'll we do, man?

00:11:42.010 --> 00:11:45.620
Understood. I'll start the investigation.

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:58.970
Higashio from class C hasn't come to school for days!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.050
Really?

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:05.040
You sure about this?

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.370
This is your parents', right?

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:12.950
I'd rather my parents kill me than end up in the stomach of that monster!

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:14.680
Okay.

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:19.980
Then, sign these papers, and I will take you into hiding.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:21.790
Hiding? Then...

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:24.620
I must protect my clients.

00:12:25.360 --> 00:12:30.710
The investigation will take a week. Food will be provided, so do not worry.

00:12:45.340 --> 00:12:46.670
Here...

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:54.710
Higashio! Itakura!

00:12:55.610 --> 00:12:57.200
Hey, what's the meaning of this?

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.440
Why are you here?

00:12:58.730 --> 00:12:59.440
Idiots!

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:00.480
Don't let the door close!

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:06.320
Huh?

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.270
It's no use. It won't open from this side.

00:13:08.710 --> 00:13:10.450
What's going on?

00:13:10.450 --> 00:13:12.200
I dunno!

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:13.240
So basically...

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:19.100
A week ago, after we split up, Higashio couldn't help worrying,

00:13:19.100 --> 00:13:24.210
so he talked to Ango-san, got an intro, asked for an investigation, and was isolated here.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:28.350
And then, after the three of us came here,

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:30.520
I went for advice at the Yumeno clinic myself,

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:31.830
and was isolated here.

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:35.010
So this time, it's you two.

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.630
So all of us requested the same investigation?

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:40.330
But he didn't say anything about that!

00:13:40.330 --> 00:13:42.230
Confidentiality of his patients, I guess.

00:13:42.230 --> 00:13:44.810
And he got more than 10 million for keeping quiet.

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:45.620
I dunno what to say...

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:47.670
That bastard!

00:13:47.670 --> 00:13:50.580
I'm going to be helping out at Ango-san's place next month.

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.880
Higashio's messed up!

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:55.000
He said he'd help out <i>here</i>!

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:57.960
Call it off! There's no point to this!

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:01.980
Investigations cannot be called off by the client once begun.

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:03.650
It's written in the contract.

00:14:03.650 --> 00:14:05.990
You're already acting like his assistant?!

00:14:05.990 --> 00:14:07.340
This is a fraud!

00:14:07.390 --> 00:14:09.100
It was all just an act!

00:14:09.100 --> 00:14:10.340
Not true.

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:10.830
Nope.

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:12.940
How are you so sure?

00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:21.870
Take a look.

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:31.430
What... is this?

00:14:32.070 --> 00:14:35.440
This is all that dude's research.

00:14:35.710 --> 00:14:37.460
T-They're fake, right?

00:14:37.640 --> 00:14:39.510
Think so now?

00:14:46.300 --> 00:14:50.360
This guy planted all the seaweed in here.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.370
It even seems to test the water quality.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:54.330
Of course, it has no official name.

00:14:54.330 --> 00:14:55.780
You're kiddin' me...

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.380
If it's a fraud, this wouldn't be here.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:15:00.150
Exactly.

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:04.720
It seems like there are a lot of unknown organisms living nearby lately.

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:07.100
Behind the back alleys of the red-light district.

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:08.760
Living in apartments.

00:15:09.440 --> 00:15:11.840
In the class next door at school.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.970
They're so close, no one notices.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.940
I know who did it.

00:15:23.090 --> 00:15:24.110
Ran away from home?

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:29.470
I met her by chance. She told me to bring you, because she wanted to talk with you.

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:32.420
I wish she would have confided in me first...

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:35.150
It seems she had a fight with her parents over her path in life.

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:36.900
She said there wasn't time to tell anyone.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:41.190
You'll come with me, right?

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:42.440
Yamamoto?!

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:45.930
There are two types that take human form.

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:49.040
There are those that don elaborate costumes,

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.510
and those that change the shape of their own bodies.

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:56.170
Either way, there's an easy way to see through them.

00:15:56.600 --> 00:15:57.870
Their fingerprints.

00:15:58.310 --> 00:16:02.370
When you touch things, the secretions from your skin leave fingerprints.

00:16:02.920 --> 00:16:05.390
However, costumes have no fingerprints,

00:16:05.390 --> 00:16:08.640
and the secretions of those who change form differ.

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:12.150
After examining the pens they held to take a street survey,

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:11.440
Komiyama

00:16:08.640 --> 00:16:12.130
Horikoshi

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:14.990
Yamamoto

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:14.990
Horikoshi

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:16.210
only the pen he held was perfectly clean.

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:16.210
Horikoshi

00:16:14.990 --> 00:16:16.230
Yamamoto

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.550
What is that?

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:27.510
I was curious, so I called out his little brother from their residence and hypnotized him.

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:31.750
With this, you'll know their true identity.

00:16:32.840 --> 00:16:34.650
Just relax, okay?

00:16:35.110 --> 00:16:36.020
Okay.

00:16:37.050 --> 00:16:40.250
Good. Now, I'm going to ask you a few questions.

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:41.140
Okay.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:44.020
Are you an Earthling?

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:45.890
No.

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.560
We came from a planet called Conwell.

00:16:49.180 --> 00:16:51.430
How many of you are on Earth?

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:53.140
Three.

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:56.500
Dad, me, and my brother.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.820
Why did you come to Earth?

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:02.770
Because... Because our planet exploded.

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:04.190
I see.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:15.220
A war started.

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.820
Because of that, our planet exploded.

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:19.970
What about the other people?

00:17:19.970 --> 00:17:23.680
I think everyone else died, or ran away to other planets.

00:17:24.100 --> 00:17:25.700
And your mother?

00:17:25.700 --> 00:17:26.940
She's dead.

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:31.210
On our planet, men eat the women to have children.

00:17:31.580 --> 00:17:36.430
So, when we become adults, we get more and more urges to eat women...

00:17:40.140 --> 00:17:42.830
Have you had times you wanted to eat them?

00:17:43.470 --> 00:17:47.020
Yeah... But not just anyone in particular.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:49.490
There's a girl who's my type...

00:17:49.490 --> 00:17:52.290
What do you do when you feel like eating them?

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:54.500
It calms down when I take medicine.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.870
But, we only have a little left.

00:17:57.870 --> 00:18:01.010
Can you make children if you eat human women?

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:04.460
Dad said it was no use...

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:06.400
Even so, you wish to eat them?

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:07.040
Yeah.

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:11.210
On Conwell, it's called the "hidden stomach".

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:12.820
"Hidden stomach"?

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.610
And that medicine fills it up, yes?

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.520
Yes.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:21.470
But some people said it was unnatural, and a war broke out...

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:26.530
They said that dad shouldn't have given birth to us.

00:18:27.180 --> 00:18:30.710
What do you think about that?

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:33.320
I think... I understand now.

00:18:46.420 --> 00:18:48.210
Why?

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:52.050
I... have a girl I like!

00:18:54.780 --> 00:18:59.500
Sometimes I really, really want to eat her!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:02.350
But I don't want to eat her!

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:06.440
I don't know what to do...

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:06.690
Are you okay?

00:19:06.690 --> 00:19:08.560
I'm going all wrong...

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:10.020
I'm going crazy!

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:11.780
Calm down, stay calm.

00:19:10.620 --> 00:19:13.400
I can't stand it! I can't stand it any longer!

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:16.160
You'll catch a cold.

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.550
Judging from our conversation,

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:46.990
they are a species where males detect female ovulation, and eat them to fertilize the eggs.

00:19:47.980 --> 00:19:50.720
Their planet must have been lacking a sufficient food supply.

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:59.510
The tragedy is likely that they evolved to the point of having romantic feelings.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:05.350
There are only three of their race, and they live with immense guilt.

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:08.380
Furthermore, there is no danger to you, as you are boys.

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:13.060
Well, the four of you paid for the investigation, so let's make it 1 million each.

00:20:14.380 --> 00:20:16.330
What, worried about your girlfriend?

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.320
She ain't the type to get herself eaten without tellin' me!

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:24.570
Scratch that, I'm gonna call her.

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:27.220
Man, I wish I had a girlfriend.

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:31.870
Hibino Moe disappeared.

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:36.550
And, at the same time, Yamamoto and his family disappeared.

00:20:37.060 --> 00:20:41.810
The press went wild for a time...

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.810
but the case remains unsolved.

00:20:46.560 --> 00:20:49.300
I thought, maybe I wanted to say something to Yamamoto...

00:20:49.320 --> 00:20:50.820
Hidden stomach...

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:54.110
But when I realized there was nothing I could say,

00:20:51.070 --> 00:20:54.110
I stopped thinking about it.

00:20:56.370 --> 00:20:58.830
If you tell me not to sleep starting tomorrow, I'm still going to get sleepy.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:03.080
Thanks for waiting!

00:21:04.210 --> 00:21:05.790
And if you say "Don't eat!", I'll still get hungry.

00:21:06.160 --> 00:21:08.090
I'll take a drumstick!

00:21:08.090 --> 00:21:09.360
I'll have a breast.

00:21:09.440 --> 00:21:11.000
You guys have changed.

00:21:11.000 --> 00:21:13.040
The cartilage is the best part, man!

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:15.370
Maybe we're not so different.

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:20.300
Yeah... We can't say anything.

00:21:20.660 --> 00:21:22.280
The End.

00:21:22.280 --> 00:21:23.850
What do you think?

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:28.140
The theme's a little dark. Those ain't so popular these days.

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:29.270
Isn't there a bright side to it?

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:34.800
But then that wouldn't express the true form of aliens to the Earthlings!

00:21:35.070 --> 00:21:38.920
Because, you see... These aliens actually exist!

00:21:39.630 --> 00:21:41.970
Crap, he's one of <i>those</i>...

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:43.150
What?

00:21:44.220 --> 00:21:45.670
And that's how it went.

00:21:45.670 --> 00:21:53.420
Fourth Meeting of the Alien
Criminal Defense Task Force

00:21:45.720 --> 00:21:48.670
The plan to convey a message to the Earthlings

00:21:48.670 --> 00:21:53.420
about the existence of extraterrestrial life via the world of fiction has ended in failure.

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:56.990
Are you sure we shouldn't be debugging, Chairman?

00:21:57.420 --> 00:21:59.100
Then, onto the next plan...

00:21:58.250 --> 00:22:01.520
Objection! We would also like to be involved in the plan!

00:22:01.520 --> 00:22:02.490
It is no use.

00:22:02.470 --> 00:22:13.480
Earth
Defense
Task
Force
Headquarters

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:06.220
We will gather together 5 elementary school children with a strong sense of justice,

00:22:03.100 --> 00:22:08.850
Presently, hundreds of different aliens come to and go from the Earth, living their lives.

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.930
and form a group of Earth Rangers.

00:22:07.930 --> 00:22:09.150
Why elementary school kids?

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:11.890
Each of them will wear a different color costume,

00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:13.530
These many different aliens live among us, maintaining a precarious balance.

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:13.530
and they'll battle bad aliens!

00:22:13.900 --> 00:22:15.500
This is <i>my</i> apartment!

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:18.140
Get the hell out already!

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:24.860
And among them are a number that are quite audacious.

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:38.100
Do not fear 'ima' mugen no kanata ni mienai mono o miyoutoshite

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:38.100
Do not fear 'The Now' searching for something that can't be seen across this infinite distance

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:52.320
nante oku no kirameki no shita de yume o sagasu kimi o mitsuketa

00:22:38.100 --> 00:22:52.320
Under the hundred million glittering lights, I found you searching for your dream

00:22:52.320 --> 00:23:01.080
garasudama no naka hirogaru mugen no sekai

00:22:52.320 --> 00:23:01.080
An infinite world filled with glass shards

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:13.140
imi no nai koto takusan shitte otona ni natta kigashiteita

00:23:02.250 --> 00:23:13.140
Growing up I felt I knew many meaningless things

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:20.600
chiribame rare ta kimi ha tada kagayaki nagara sora ni mau kako mo mirai mo nai mama ni

00:23:13.140 --> 00:23:20.600
Shining like a jewel, you soar in the sky, no past, no future

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:25.940
kotae ha sora no mukou gawa

00:23:20.600 --> 00:23:25.940
The answer is beyond the sky

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:36.450
Do not fear 'yume' mugen no kanata ni shinjitsu mo uso mo mie nai mama de

00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:36.450
Do not fear 'The Dream', in a distant
place where truth and lies are unseen

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:52.180
nante oku no kirameki no shita de kaze ni yureru hana ha yurameku

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:52.180
Under the hundred million glittering lights, flowers sway in the wind

00:23:56.730 --> 00:23:58.930
And that ends class for today!

00:23:58.550 --> 00:24:00.880
Tachibana-sensei is an alien?

00:23:59.930 --> 00:24:03.970
Aliens... It's not just Tachibana-sensei, it's... more like...

00:24:04.470 --> 00:24:07.410
For payment, she takes the lives of babies.

00:24:07.410 --> 00:24:09.060
She's a cold-hearted assassin.

00:24:08.650 --> 00:24:10.980
Why are we wrapped up in this?

00:24:10.980 --> 00:24:12.270
Are you serious?

00:24:11.060 --> 00:24:14.030
We're gonna be killed! We're gonna be killed!

00:24:14.030 --> 00:24:17.210
Next time: Here come Color ranger!!

00:24:17.210 --> 00:24:19.410
You're really an assassin?

00:24:19.410 --> 00:24:20.570
Really.
